SCOPE

This licence covers the source code written for this project:

  1_verify/                      the offline verification
  2_operator/                    the SADA operator
  3_experiments/_extract_prompts.py
  4_code/benchmark/              the generation and scoring code for Exp. 1-4

It does NOT cover:

  4_code/TextTabBench/           derived from a third-party repository that
                                 carried no licence. See the notice in that
                                 directory and THIRD_PARTY.md.

  the archived experiment outputs under 3_experiments/*/raw/ and
  3_experiments/*/tables/
                                 released under CC BY 4.0. See LICENSE-DATA.

  any third-party dataset content quoted inside those outputs
                                 governed by each dataset's own terms; this
                                 project does not redistribute the datasets
                                 themselves. See THIRD_PARTY.md.
